00:14:19,942 --> 00:14:21,694
<font color="white">I must've caught you off guard,</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:14:23,112 --> 00:14:24,113
<font color="white">showing up unannounced.</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:14:29,326 --> 00:14:30,703
<font color="white">You probably don't remember,</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:14:31,453 --> 00:14:33,455
<font color="white">but we went to</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Korea Arts High School together.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

161
00:14:34,623 --> 00:14:36,000
<font color="white">I'm Kang Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:14:41,589 --> 00:14:42,673
<font color="white">You can speak casually.</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:14:43,215 --> 00:14:44,341
<font color="white">I'm fine with whatever.</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:14:46,010 --> 00:14:47,177
<font color="white">Okay.</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:14:49,263 --> 00:14:51,265
<font color="white">I thought you were dead.</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:14:53,976 --> 00:14:55,352
<font color="white">I'm so thankful…</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:14:57,813 --> 00:14:59,064
<font color="white">that you made it back alive.</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:14:59,773 --> 00:15:01,442
<font color="white">Why are you thankful for that?</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:15:01,942 --> 00:15:02,902
<font color="white">Well…</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:15:04,904 --> 00:15:06,447
<font color="white">because you were my friend…</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:15:08,949 --> 00:15:11,493
<font color="white">and I prayed for you to be alive.</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:15:15,289 --> 00:15:16,332
<font color="white">By the way,</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:15:16,999 --> 00:15:19,627
<font color="white">how did you lose your memory?</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:15:20,252 --> 00:15:21,795
<font color="white">Do I need to answer that?</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:15:21,879 --> 00:15:24,423
<font color="white">No, you don't have to.</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:15:27,760 --> 00:15:32,264
<font color="white">So why are you conducting</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">instead of playing the piano?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

177
00:15:33,432 --> 00:15:36,769
<font color="white">I mean, your conducting</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">is wonderful and moving.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

178
00:15:36,852 --> 00:15:38,938
<font color="white">But you loved playing the piano,</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:15:39,021 --> 00:15:41,065
<font color="white">so I was wondering if you quit entirely.</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:15:41,732 --> 00:15:43,567
<font color="white">You're going to play again, right?</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:15:43,651 --> 00:15:45,903
<font color="white">Why are you asking me that?</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:15:46,820 --> 00:15:47,655
<font color="white">What?</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:15:47,738 --> 00:15:50,407
<font color="white">If that's all you came to ask,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">please leave.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

184
00:15:56,747 --> 00:15:59,166
<font color="white">From now on,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">please don't allow any personal visits.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

185
00:15:59,249 --> 00:16:01,627
<font color="white">I thought I made myself clear.</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:16:11,136 --> 00:16:13,472
<font color="white">Anyway, thank you for coming back.</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:16:14,473 --> 00:16:17,476
<font color="white">If you ever come to Korea, give me a call.</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:16:21,271 --> 00:16:22,773
<font color="white">Can I give you a hug?</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:16:23,482 --> 00:16:24,316
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:17:12,448 --> 00:17:13,532
<font color="white">Yes, Mr. Kang?</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:17:13,615 --> 00:17:15,117
<font color="white">Have you arrived?</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:17,619
<font color="white">Yes, I just arrived.</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:17:17,703 --> 00:17:21,123
<font color="white">So, have you thought of a way?</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:17:22,666 --> 00:17:23,709
<font color="white">Based on the articles,</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:17:23,792 --> 00:17:26,587
<font color="white">if we push too hard right away,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">it might backfire.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

196
00:17:27,171 --> 00:17:31,383
<font color="white"><i>I think the best approach is to assure him</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>he can pursue the music he wants.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:17:31,467 --> 00:17:32,551
<font color="white">And the orchestra members?</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:17:33,052 --> 00:17:35,512
<font color="white"><i>I think they'll at least be intrigued.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:17:36,013 --> 00:17:39,349
<font color="white">He's back after almost ten years,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and his talent speaks for itself.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

200
00:17:39,433 --> 00:17:40,267
<font color="white">That said,</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:17:40,851 --> 00:17:43,103
<font color="white">we need to make sure</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the process looks legitimate</font><font color="white"></font></font>

202
00:17:43,187 --> 00:17:45,522
<font color="white">to prevent any talk</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of preferential treatment.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

203
00:17:45,606 --> 00:17:47,399
<font color="white">The concertmaster should be fine…</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:17:49,401 --> 00:17:52,446
<font color="white">but there might be pushback</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from the cello section.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

205
00:17:53,322 --> 00:17:54,656
<font color="white">You must keep a tight rein on things.</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:17:55,407 --> 00:17:56,241
<font color="white"><i>I will.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:17:56,325 --> 00:17:59,119
<font color="white">Did you like his performance that much?</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:18:00,204 --> 00:18:01,830
<font color="white">Granted, he was very good.</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:18:03,040 --> 00:18:05,626
<font color="white">But you're still healthy.</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:18:05,709 --> 00:18:07,628
<font color="white">So why are you rushing--</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:18:07,711 --> 00:18:10,380
<font color="white"><i>It's not about me liking him or not.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:18:10,881 --> 00:18:14,051
<font color="white">When God bestows a talent,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">it comes with a calling.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

213
00:18:16,136 --> 00:18:19,681
<font color="white">Shouldn't we help him</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">make the most of that talent?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

214
00:18:25,437 --> 00:18:28,398
<font color="white">The president of the Korean symphony,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Seon-ju Yoon, has arrived.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

215
00:18:28,482 --> 00:18:29,525
<font color="white">Okay.</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:18:42,496 --> 00:18:44,665
<font color="white">Good afternoon, Mr. Domenico.</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:18:46,125 --> 00:18:47,042
<font color="white">I am</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:18:47,876 --> 00:18:49,044
<font color="white">Seon-ju Yoon,</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:18:50,337 --> 00:18:52,005
<font color="white">president of the Korean symphony.</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:18:55,509 --> 00:18:56,760
<font color="white">Do you still remember…</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:18:59,221 --> 00:19:00,556
<font color="white">how to speak Korean?</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:19:06,812 --> 00:19:08,188
<font color="white">-You're here.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Oh, hi.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

223
00:19:09,064 --> 00:19:12,192
<font color="white">Where's Pi-o?</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:19:13,026 --> 00:19:14,278
<font color="white">He's in the practice room,</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:19:14,987 --> 00:19:17,614
<font color="white">but he still hasn't played a note.</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:19:41,054 --> 00:19:42,306
<font color="white">Are you okay now?</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:19:44,558 --> 00:19:45,976
<font color="white">You must've been shocked.</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:19:52,399 --> 00:19:55,527
<font color="white">It's such a relief though.</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:19:56,111 --> 00:19:58,488
<font color="white">We thought he was dead,</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:19:58,572 --> 00:20:00,157
<font color="white">but he came back alive.</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:20:01,408 --> 00:20:03,994
<font color="white">How was it meeting him?</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:20:04,661 --> 00:20:06,413
<font color="white">He wasn't happy to see me.</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:20:07,039 --> 00:20:08,624
<font color="white">I just said hello and left.</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:20:10,792 --> 00:20:11,627
<font color="white">I see.</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:20:13,462 --> 00:20:14,546
<font color="white">Well,</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:20:14,630 --> 00:20:17,341
<font color="white">it must've been awkward</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">having someone he doesn't remember</font><font color="white"></font></font>

237
00:20:17,424 --> 00:20:19,176
<font color="white">acting familiar with him.</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:20:21,053 --> 00:20:24,848
<font color="white">Did you tell him</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that you'd been searching for him?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

239
00:20:27,684 --> 00:20:28,518
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:20:28,602 --> 00:20:30,437
<font color="white">Why not?</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:20:30,520 --> 00:20:32,481
<font color="white">You're the only one who never gave up</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:20:32,981 --> 00:20:35,275
<font color="white">when everyone else forgot about him.</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:20:35,901 --> 00:20:37,069
<font color="white">You should've told him.</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:20:40,197 --> 00:20:41,198
<font color="white">In any case,</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:20:41,823 --> 00:20:43,825
<font color="white">everything turned out well.</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:20:44,493 --> 00:20:46,453
<font color="white">Jeong-yo is back safe and sound.</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:20:47,162 --> 00:20:50,249
<font color="white">Once he gets adjusted</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and starts performing again,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

248
00:20:51,083 --> 00:20:52,334
<font color="white">you'll be running into him.</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:20:58,757 --> 00:21:02,803
<font color="white">So when are you going to</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">start practicing again?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

250
00:21:06,765 --> 00:21:09,309
<font color="white">Jeong-yo's back now.</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:21:09,393 --> 00:21:11,311
<font color="white">Maybe you should set your worries aside</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:21:11,812 --> 00:21:14,273
<font color="white">-and slowly start--</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Is that why you came?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

253
00:21:14,856 --> 00:21:16,358
<font color="white">I'm just worried</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:21:17,567 --> 00:21:19,569
<font color="white">because you've been on hiatus for so long.</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:21:19,653 --> 00:21:21,405
<font color="white">I'll handle my own business.</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:21:21,488 --> 00:21:22,447
<font color="white">Do you…</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:21:23,991 --> 00:21:26,076
<font color="white">still need more time?</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:21:52,144 --> 00:21:53,061
<font color="white">Go already.</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:21:58,191 --> 00:22:01,236
<font color="white">KOREA ARTS HIGH SCHOOL</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:22:05,198 --> 00:22:07,701
<font color="white">I'm the king of the world!</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:22:49,451 --> 00:22:50,410
<font color="white"><i>Hey, Jeong-yo.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:22:51,661 --> 00:22:52,871
<font color="white"><i>Let's be practice partners.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:22:55,332 --> 00:22:56,416
<font color="white">What do you mean?</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:22:57,125 --> 00:22:59,419
<font color="white">You said you were too busy</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">preparing for the competition.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

265
00:22:59,503 --> 00:23:00,796
<font color="white"><i>No, I'm not entering.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:23:01,713 --> 00:23:03,507
<font color="white"><i>I want to be your practice partner</i></font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:23:03,590 --> 00:23:06,301
<font color="white">and find a way to be happy making music.</font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:23:07,010 --> 00:23:08,512
<font color="white">You'll help me, right?</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:23:39,209 --> 00:23:40,085
<font color="white">Jeong-yo?</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:23:44,047 --> 00:23:45,173
<font color="white">Kang Pi-o?</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:23:50,387 --> 00:23:52,055
<font color="white">You're Kang Pi-o, right?</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:23:52,848 --> 00:23:53,974
<font color="white">We met in Brno.</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:23:57,644 --> 00:23:58,478
<font color="white">Yeah.</font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:24:01,523 --> 00:24:02,858
<font color="white">When did you come to Korea?</font><font color="white"></font>

275
00:24:03,525 --> 00:24:06,528
<font color="white">It hasn't been long.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I'm here to discuss something for work.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

276
00:24:08,697 --> 00:24:10,157
<font color="white">What brings you to school?</font><font color="white"></font>

277
00:24:10,240 --> 00:24:14,161
<font color="white">I found online that I used to go here.</font><font color="white"></font>

278
00:24:15,078 --> 00:24:16,037
<font color="white">So I stopped by,</font><font color="white"></font>

279
00:24:16,955 --> 00:24:18,748
<font color="white">but I don't know where anything is.</font><font color="white"></font>

280
00:24:24,171 --> 00:24:25,505
<font color="white">Are you just here to look around?</font><font color="white"></font>

281
00:24:26,214 --> 00:24:27,382
<font color="white">Yeah.</font><font color="white"></font>

282
00:24:29,342 --> 00:24:30,927
<font color="white">-So…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-You know…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

283
00:24:32,888 --> 00:24:33,889
<font color="white">Go ahead.</font><font color="white"></font>

284
00:24:33,972 --> 00:24:35,640
<font color="white">No, you first.</font><font color="white"></font>

285
00:24:36,224 --> 00:24:37,350
<font color="white">Shall I then?</font><font color="white"></font>

286
00:24:39,477 --> 00:24:40,645
<font color="white">I'm sorry about before.</font><font color="white"></font>

287
00:24:42,147 --> 00:24:44,816
<font color="white">I felt extra defensive</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">around strangers at the time,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

288
00:24:45,650 --> 00:24:47,527
<font color="white">and I was tired from the competition.</font><font color="white"></font>

289
00:24:48,153 --> 00:24:49,029
<font color="white">I just…</font><font color="white"></font>

290
00:24:49,821 --> 00:24:52,073
<font color="white">I behaved rather rudely toward you.</font><font color="white"></font>

291
00:24:52,699 --> 00:24:53,533
<font color="white">I'm sorry.</font><font color="white"></font>

292
00:24:55,160 --> 00:24:56,286
<font color="white">No, not at all.</font><font color="white"></font>

293
00:24:56,369 --> 00:24:59,122
<font color="white">Someone you don't even remember</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">came by to grill you,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

294
00:24:59,206 --> 00:25:00,790
<font color="white">so of course, you felt uncomfortable.</font><font color="white"></font>

295
00:25:05,670 --> 00:25:07,339
<font color="white">Right, so…</font><font color="white"></font>

296
00:25:10,133 --> 00:25:12,677
<font color="white">If you don't know where anything is,</font><font color="white"></font>

297
00:25:12,761 --> 00:25:14,179
<font color="white">I can show you around.</font><font color="white"></font>

298
00:25:22,145 --> 00:25:23,855
<font color="white">So what brings you to Korea?</font><font color="white"></font>

299
00:25:25,065 --> 00:25:26,149
<font color="white">Oh, the thing is…</font><font color="white"></font>

300
00:25:27,317 --> 00:25:30,195
<font color="white">I got an offer to be a guest conductor</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for the Hankook Symphony Orchestra.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

301
00:25:30,862 --> 00:25:31,821
<font color="white">Really?</font><font color="white"></font>

302
00:25:32,364 --> 00:25:33,240
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

303
00:25:36,493 --> 00:25:37,369
<font color="white">So…</font><font color="white"></font>

304
00:25:38,620 --> 00:25:39,871
<font color="white">Are you going to accept?</font><font color="white"></font>

305
00:25:41,581 --> 00:25:42,624
<font color="white">I don't know.</font><font color="white"></font>

306
00:25:43,792 --> 00:25:45,210
<font color="white">I'm not sure yet.</font><font color="white"></font>

307
00:25:45,919 --> 00:25:48,838
<font color="white">On one hand, it's my homeland,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so it might be better than elsewhere.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

308
00:25:49,798 --> 00:25:51,716
<font color="white">On the other hand,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">it might confuse me more.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

309
00:25:53,260 --> 00:25:54,177
<font color="white">By the way…</font><font color="white"></font>

310
00:25:57,097 --> 00:25:58,640
<font color="white">Were we close friends?</font><font color="white"></font>

311
00:26:00,225 --> 00:26:02,477
<font color="white">We both entered the Harmonie Competition.</font><font color="white"></font>

312
00:26:04,271 --> 00:26:06,314
<font color="white">Since you made such an effort to see me,</font><font color="white"></font>

313
00:26:07,607 --> 00:26:09,943
<font color="white">I wondered if we had a special bond.</font><font color="white"></font>

314
00:26:12,821 --> 00:26:13,780
<font color="white">Well…</font><font color="white"></font>

315
00:26:15,282 --> 00:26:16,825
<font color="white">I thought we were close.</font><font color="white"></font>

316
00:26:39,347 --> 00:26:41,558
<font color="white">This was our classroom.</font><font color="white"></font>

317
00:26:42,142 --> 00:26:44,269
<font color="white">You transferred here during 10th grade</font><font color="white"></font>

318
00:26:45,770 --> 00:26:47,105
<font color="white">as a gifted scholar.</font><font color="white"></font>

319
00:26:59,868 --> 00:27:01,202
<font color="white">Where was my desk?</font><font color="white"></font>

320
00:27:02,829 --> 00:27:03,705
<font color="white">Over there.</font><font color="white"></font>

321
00:27:11,880 --> 00:27:13,631
<font color="white">And where was your desk?</font><font color="white"></font>

322
00:27:16,217 --> 00:27:17,218
<font color="white">Right here.</font><font color="white"></font>

323
00:27:22,891 --> 00:27:23,767
<font color="white">Yes!</font><font color="white"></font>

324
00:27:27,729 --> 00:27:29,272
<font color="white">Do you remember anything?</font><font color="white"></font>

325
00:27:30,565 --> 00:27:31,775
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

326
00:27:31,858 --> 00:27:34,361
<font color="white">I guess I didn't</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">put much effort into school.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

327
00:27:36,613 --> 00:27:38,490
<font color="white">No, not really.</font><font color="white"></font>

328
00:27:39,157 --> 00:27:40,992
<font color="white">Then what did I put effort into?</font><font color="white"></font>

329
00:27:51,628 --> 00:27:54,214
<font color="white">This is where we'd practice</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">playing four hands.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

330
00:27:55,423 --> 00:27:57,967
<font color="white">You put the most effort</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">into playing the piano.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

331
00:27:58,551 --> 00:28:00,595
<font color="white">Thanks to you,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">this place and the practice room</font><font color="white"></font></font>

332
00:28:00,678 --> 00:28:02,263
<font color="white">basically became my second home.</font><font color="white"></font>

333
00:28:11,189 --> 00:28:12,690
<font color="white">What did we play?</font><font color="white"></font>

334
00:28:13,942 --> 00:28:15,110
<font color="white">Can you play it?</font><font color="white"></font>

335
00:28:36,548 --> 00:28:38,716
<font color="white">My tendinitis has flared up again,</font><font color="white"></font>

336
00:28:39,342 --> 00:28:41,177
<font color="white">so playing has been a bit uncomfortable.</font><font color="white"></font>

337
00:28:41,261 --> 00:28:42,470
<font color="white">You're in a slump.</font><font color="white"></font>

338
00:28:44,347 --> 00:28:45,181
<font color="white">No, I'm not.</font><font color="white"></font>

339
00:28:45,265 --> 00:28:47,058
<font color="white">How did you fall into a slump?</font><font color="white"></font>

340
00:28:49,519 --> 00:28:50,854
<font color="white">I said I'm not in a slump.</font><font color="white"></font>

341
00:29:24,304 --> 00:29:25,388
<font color="white">You asked me before</font><font color="white"></font>

342
00:29:26,264 --> 00:29:28,516
<font color="white">why I'm conducting instead of playing.</font><font color="white"></font>

343
00:29:29,893 --> 00:29:30,935
<font color="white">Nine years ago,</font><font color="white"></font>

344
00:29:32,228 --> 00:29:34,314
<font color="white">I got shot in my right shoulder.</font><font color="white"></font>

345
00:29:35,315 --> 00:29:36,524
<font color="white">It was not the plan.</font><font color="white"></font>

346
00:29:37,108 --> 00:29:41,529
<font color="white">The plan was to let him go</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">after we got the money.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

347
00:29:41,613 --> 00:29:42,697
<font color="white">But…</font><font color="white"></font>

348
00:29:43,239 --> 00:29:45,617
<font color="white">he put up a bit too much of a fight.</font><font color="white"></font>

349
00:29:45,700 --> 00:29:47,243
<font color="white">It caused nerve damage in my fingers.</font><font color="white"></font>

350
00:29:47,327 --> 00:29:50,205
<font color="white">I can get through daily life,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">but I can't play anymore.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

351
00:29:51,623 --> 00:29:53,750
<font color="white">So I switched to conducting.</font><font color="white"></font>

352
00:29:54,959 --> 00:29:56,961
<font color="white">But when I really want to play the piano,</font><font color="white"></font>

353
00:29:58,630 --> 00:29:59,714
<font color="white">I play this piece</font><font color="white"></font>

354
00:30:01,257 --> 00:30:02,801
<font color="white">and thank Brahms for it.</font><font color="white"></font>

355
00:30:11,684 --> 00:30:13,978
<font color="white">I know how difficult it must be for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

356
00:30:15,647 --> 00:30:18,024
<font color="white">Take away music from a musician,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and he's left with hell.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

357
00:30:19,275 --> 00:30:20,568
<font color="white">But a slump…</font><font color="white"></font>

358
00:30:22,195 --> 00:30:24,030
<font color="white">is something you can work your way out of.</font><font color="white"></font>

359
00:30:26,491 --> 00:30:27,492
<font color="white">That's not the case for me.</font><font color="white"></font>

360
00:30:30,286 --> 00:30:32,247
<font color="white">I'm actually envious of you.</font><font color="white"></font>

361
00:30:38,086 --> 00:30:39,587
<font color="white">Thank you for today.</font><font color="white"></font>

362
00:30:42,048 --> 00:30:43,174
<font color="white">Let's meet again sometime.</font><font color="white"></font>

363
00:30:48,555 --> 00:30:50,431
<font color="white">Okay. Take care.</font><font color="white"></font>

364
00:30:51,683 --> 00:30:53,309
<font color="white">Let me know if you need any help.</font><font color="white"></font>

365
00:31:05,905 --> 00:31:07,407
<font color="white"><i>Nine years ago,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

366
00:31:08,032 --> 00:31:09,951
<font color="white"><i>I got shot in my right shoulder.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

367
00:31:10,994 --> 00:31:12,620
<font color="white"><i>It caused nerve damage in my fingers.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

368
00:31:12,704 --> 00:31:15,331
<font color="white"><i>I can get through daily life,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>but I can't play anymore.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

369
00:31:16,040 --> 00:31:17,208
<font color="white"><i>Was it for money?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

370
00:31:17,292 --> 00:31:19,460
<font color="white"><i>Did you abduct him for that reason</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>or did someone--</i></font><font color="white"></font></font>

371
00:31:19,544 --> 00:31:20,420
<font color="white">Enough.</font><font color="white"></font>

372
00:31:20,503 --> 00:31:21,671
<font color="white">You want to know?</font><font color="white"></font>

373
00:31:22,380 --> 00:31:23,798
<font color="white">Three million lei.</font><font color="white"></font>

374
00:31:23,882 --> 00:31:25,174
<font color="white">Then I'll tell you.</font><font color="white"></font>

375
00:31:26,092 --> 00:31:27,093
<font color="white">Where have you been?</font><font color="white"></font>

376
00:31:32,181 --> 00:31:35,018
<font color="white"><i>"You will again see the distinction</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>between the righteous and the wicked,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

377
00:31:35,101 --> 00:31:38,897
<font color="white">between those who serve God</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and those who do not."</font><font color="white"></font></font>

378
00:31:40,523 --> 00:31:41,441
<font color="white">"'For behold,</font><font color="white"></font>

379
00:31:42,483 --> 00:31:44,402
<font color="white">the day is coming, burning like an oven."</font><font color="white"></font>

380
00:31:46,070 --> 00:31:48,114
<font color="white">"Says the Lord of hosts,</font><font color="white"></font>

381
00:31:49,741 --> 00:31:52,535
<font color="white">'Not a root or a branch…</font><font color="white"></font>

382
00:31:54,162 --> 00:31:55,580
<font color="white">will be left to them.'"</font><font color="white"></font>

383
00:31:58,416 --> 00:31:59,334
<font color="white">Hello, ma'am.</font><font color="white"></font>

384
00:32:00,335 --> 00:32:02,420
<font color="white">Are Pi-o and Father home?</font><font color="white"></font>

385
00:32:02,503 --> 00:32:05,256
<font color="white">Mr. Kang hasn't arrived yet,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and Pi-o is in his room.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

386
00:32:06,341 --> 00:32:08,176
<font color="white">Would you like me to prepare dinner?</font><font color="white"></font>

387
00:32:08,259 --> 00:32:09,218
<font color="white">No, I'm not hungry.</font><font color="white"></font>

388
00:32:20,980 --> 00:32:21,856
<font color="white">Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

389
00:32:24,776 --> 00:32:26,027
<font color="white">What are you doing here?</font><font color="white"></font>

390
00:32:26,110 --> 00:32:27,946
<font color="white">Where have you been, Mom?</font><font color="white"></font>

391
00:32:28,529 --> 00:32:29,405
<font color="white">I was at church.</font><font color="white"></font>

392
00:32:30,657 --> 00:32:33,701
<font color="white">I was there volunteering as a lector.</font><font color="white"></font>

393
00:32:37,789 --> 00:32:38,706
<font color="white">Mom.</font><font color="white"></font>

394
00:32:41,459 --> 00:32:42,293
<font color="white">Yes?</font><font color="white"></font>

395
00:32:44,212 --> 00:32:45,129
<font color="white">Articles about Jeong-yo…</font><font color="white"></font>

396
00:32:47,131 --> 00:32:48,383
<font color="white">You've read them too, right?</font><font color="white"></font>

397
00:32:49,884 --> 00:32:50,718
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

398
00:32:51,344 --> 00:32:53,054
<font color="white">Yes, I have.</font><font color="white"></font>

399
00:32:53,638 --> 00:32:55,098
<font color="white">I was so surprised.</font><font color="white"></font>

400
00:32:56,349 --> 00:32:58,142
<font color="white">I'm just relieved that he's alive.</font><font color="white"></font>

401
00:33:01,688 --> 00:33:02,855
<font color="white">Are you going to see him?</font><font color="white"></font>

402
00:33:04,524 --> 00:33:05,900
<font color="white">I already have.</font><font color="white"></font>

403
00:33:07,318 --> 00:33:08,361
<font color="white">I see.</font><font color="white"></font>

404
00:33:09,028 --> 00:33:09,862
<font color="white">So…</font><font color="white"></font>

405
00:33:11,447 --> 00:33:14,200
<font color="white">Did he recognize you?</font><font color="white"></font>

406
00:33:14,283 --> 00:33:15,576
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

407
00:33:15,660 --> 00:33:16,995
<font color="white">He didn't recognize me.</font><font color="white"></font>

408
00:33:17,078 --> 00:33:18,287
<font color="white">I see.</font><font color="white"></font>

409
00:33:20,748 --> 00:33:22,750
<font color="white">I suppose life is full of surprises,</font><font color="white"></font>

410
00:33:22,834 --> 00:33:24,794
<font color="white">but how could something like that happen?</font><font color="white"></font>

411
00:33:25,586 --> 00:33:28,631
<font color="white">From the way he conducts,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">it's clear he hasn't lost his touch.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

412
00:33:29,924 --> 00:33:31,384
<font color="white">So at least there's a silver lining.</font><font color="white"></font>

413
00:33:31,467 --> 00:33:32,927
<font color="white">"Silver lining"?</font><font color="white"></font>

414
00:33:36,764 --> 00:33:38,349
<font color="white">Jeong-yo told me</font><font color="white"></font>

415
00:33:38,933 --> 00:33:41,394
<font color="white">why he switched from playing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to conducting.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

416
00:33:42,145 --> 00:33:43,187
<font color="white">Why did he?</font><font color="white"></font>

417
00:33:43,271 --> 00:33:44,313
<font color="white">Nine years ago,</font><font color="white"></font>

418
00:33:44,397 --> 00:33:47,316
<font color="white">he got shot in the shoulder</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and lost use of his right hand.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

419
00:33:48,693 --> 00:33:49,777
<font color="white">So I'm not sure…</font><font color="white"></font>

420
00:33:51,654 --> 00:33:54,157
<font color="white">if that's really a silver lining.</font><font color="white"></font>

421
00:33:58,703 --> 00:34:00,163
<font color="white">So that's what happened.</font><font color="white"></font>

422
00:34:01,539 --> 00:34:05,084
<font color="white">But there are plenty of people</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who switch from playing to conducting.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

423
00:34:05,168 --> 00:34:06,836
<font color="white">Music transcends everything.</font><font color="white"></font>

424
00:34:06,919 --> 00:34:09,922
<font color="white">As long as he's back to making music,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that's all that matters.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

425
00:34:14,385 --> 00:34:16,596
<font color="white">Volunteering after a long break</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">really takes it out of you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

426
00:34:17,305 --> 00:34:18,264
<font color="white">Good night.</font><font color="white"></font>

427
00:34:34,155 --> 00:34:36,240
<font color="white">MARTIN VOGEL</font><font color="white"></font>

428
00:34:38,951 --> 00:34:40,661
<font color="white">CALLING MARTIN VOGEL</font><font color="white"></font>

429
00:34:49,545 --> 00:34:50,963
<font color="white">Hey, Mr. Kang.</font><font color="white"></font>

430
00:34:51,047 --> 00:34:52,965
<font color="white">How are you doing?</font><font color="white"></font>

431
00:34:54,467 --> 00:34:57,929
<font color="white">If you're calling about Mr. Choi,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I don't have much to tell you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

432
00:34:58,805 --> 00:35:00,932
<font color="white">We heard the news of his death together.</font><font color="white"></font>

433
00:35:01,015 --> 00:35:02,016
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

434
00:35:03,184 --> 00:35:04,894
<font color="white">I'm not calling because of that.</font><font color="white"></font>

435
00:35:06,479 --> 00:35:07,313
<font color="white">Then what is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

436
00:35:08,064 --> 00:35:09,607
<font color="white">I have another request for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

437
00:35:10,900 --> 00:35:11,943
<font color="white">What is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

438
00:35:12,026 --> 00:35:13,111
<font color="white"><i>Look into this quietly</i></font><font color="white"></font>

439
00:35:14,320 --> 00:35:16,405
<font color="white"><i>and make sure nothing leaks.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

440
00:35:18,116 --> 00:35:19,951
<font color="white">I want to know who gave the order</font><font color="white"></font>

441
00:35:21,577 --> 00:35:23,162
<font color="white">to abduct Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

442
00:35:34,632 --> 00:35:36,342
<font color="white">You haven't decided yet?</font><font color="white"></font>

443
00:35:38,219 --> 00:35:39,053
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

444
00:35:39,679 --> 00:35:40,721
<font color="white">Well…</font><font color="white"></font>

445
00:35:41,889 --> 00:35:44,016
<font color="white">What's making you hesitate?</font><font color="white"></font>

446
00:35:44,600 --> 00:35:45,601
<font color="white">You've already seen</font><font color="white"></font>

447
00:35:46,811 --> 00:35:50,398
<font color="white">that our orchestra</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">holds its own against anyone.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

448
00:35:50,481 --> 00:35:53,776
<font color="white">Plus, you'll get the authority</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to appoint and dismiss members.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

449
00:35:53,860 --> 00:35:55,278
<font color="white">There's no better offer.</font><font color="white"></font>

450
00:35:56,320 --> 00:35:59,365
<font color="white">Isn't this the ideal stage</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to pursue your music?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

451
00:36:00,533 --> 00:36:01,409
<font color="white">I guess it is.</font><font color="white"></font>

452
00:36:02,702 --> 00:36:03,536
<font color="white">Is it the pay?</font><font color="white"></font>

453
00:36:04,412 --> 00:36:06,247
<font color="white">From our end,</font><font color="white"></font>

454
00:36:06,330 --> 00:36:08,708
<font color="white">what we're offering</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">seems reasonable enough.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

455
00:36:10,334 --> 00:36:11,919
<font color="white">Do you have a specific number in mind?</font><font color="white"></font>

456
00:36:12,545 --> 00:36:15,214
<font color="white">No, it's not about money.</font><font color="white"></font>

457
00:36:16,382 --> 00:36:17,550
<font color="white">Then what is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

458
00:36:18,134 --> 00:36:19,719
<font color="white">What's holding you back?</font><font color="white"></font>

459
00:36:22,388 --> 00:36:23,264
<font color="white">To be honest…</font><font color="white"></font>

460
00:36:25,725 --> 00:36:29,645
<font color="white">I came because I wanted to meet</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Maestro Kang Seung-woon.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

461
00:36:32,148 --> 00:36:33,816
<font color="white">I have a favor to ask him.</font><font color="white"></font>

462
00:36:34,692 --> 00:36:36,068
<font color="white">What is it? Tell me.</font><font color="white"></font>

463
00:36:42,283 --> 00:36:44,660
<font color="white">You want to ask him yourself?</font><font color="white"></font>

464
00:36:46,996 --> 00:36:49,916
<font color="white">All right, I'll arrange a meeting soon.</font><font color="white"></font>

465
00:36:51,542 --> 00:36:52,376
<font color="white">Okay.</font><font color="white"></font>

466
00:36:52,960 --> 00:36:56,005
<font color="white">By the way, you haven't signed</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with an agency yet, right?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

467
00:36:56,672 --> 00:37:00,635
<font color="white">I'd like to introduce you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to an agency I have in mind.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

468
00:37:01,177 --> 00:37:02,553
<font color="white">Can I give them your number?</font><font color="white"></font>

469
00:37:03,554 --> 00:37:04,597
<font color="white">What are they like?</font><font color="white"></font>

470
00:37:24,825 --> 00:37:25,993
<font color="white">Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

471
00:37:27,745 --> 00:37:29,622
<font color="white">It's me, Hong Jae-in.</font><font color="white"></font>

472
00:37:29,705 --> 00:37:30,748
<font color="white">Well?</font><font color="white"></font>

473
00:37:32,625 --> 00:37:34,043
<font color="white">Does my face</font><font color="white"></font>

474
00:37:34,126 --> 00:37:35,920
<font color="white">perhaps jog your memory?</font><font color="white"></font>

475
00:37:36,003 --> 00:37:36,837
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

476
00:37:39,215 --> 00:37:40,841
<font color="white">So you really do have amnesia.</font><font color="white"></font>

477
00:37:45,179 --> 00:37:48,683
<font color="white">Still, it's a huge relief,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">considering the alternatives.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

478
00:37:48,766 --> 00:37:50,810
<font color="white">I thought you were dead.</font><font color="white"></font>

479
00:37:51,310 --> 00:37:54,563
<font color="white">I was so shocked and sad</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for the longest time.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

480
00:37:57,316 --> 00:37:58,150
<font color="white">Right.</font><font color="white"></font>

481
00:37:58,734 --> 00:37:59,568
<font color="white">Hey.</font><font color="white"></font>

482
00:38:00,361 --> 00:38:02,363
<font color="white">We're friends, so drop the formality.</font><font color="white"></font>

483
00:38:02,446 --> 00:38:03,990
<font color="white">I'm about to get upset.</font><font color="white"></font>

484
00:38:06,409 --> 00:38:07,243
<font color="white">Here.</font><font color="white"></font>

485
00:38:08,369 --> 00:38:11,914
<font color="white">This is the photo I told you about.</font><font color="white"></font>

486
00:38:13,291 --> 00:38:14,500
<font color="white">Take a look at it.</font><font color="white"></font>

487
00:38:14,583 --> 00:38:18,087
<font color="white">Can't you tell how close we were?</font><font color="white"></font>

488
00:38:18,921 --> 00:38:19,797
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

489
00:38:20,881 --> 00:38:22,216
<font color="white">It seems we were.</font><font color="white"></font>

490
00:38:22,300 --> 00:38:23,301
<font color="white">That's right.</font><font color="white"></font>

491
00:38:23,843 --> 00:38:26,595
<font color="white">You were a really special friend to us.</font><font color="white"></font>

492
00:38:27,346 --> 00:38:32,393
<font color="white">That's why Pi-o refused to give up</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and continued searching for you</font><font color="white"></font></font>

493
00:38:33,102 --> 00:38:34,520
<font color="white">when you went missing.</font><font color="white"></font>

494
00:38:35,563 --> 00:38:39,525
<font color="white">The only person who didn't forget</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and kept looking for you</font><font color="white"></font></font>

495
00:38:40,151 --> 00:38:41,444
<font color="white">was Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

496
00:38:44,322 --> 00:38:45,156
<font color="white">Why?</font><font color="white"></font>

497
00:38:46,407 --> 00:38:47,491
<font color="white">Isn't it obvious?</font><font color="white"></font>

498
00:38:48,492 --> 00:38:51,162
<font color="white">He was your closest friend.</font><font color="white"></font>

499
00:38:52,788 --> 00:38:53,622
<font color="white">Actually,</font><font color="white"></font>

500
00:38:54,957 --> 00:38:58,919
<font color="white">there's a reason why I wanted to see you.</font><font color="white"></font>

501
00:39:35,414 --> 00:39:37,333
<font color="white">APPLICATION FOR APPROVAL</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">OF BUSINESS PLAN AMENDMENT</font><font color="white"></font></font>

502
00:39:37,416 --> 00:39:38,959
{\an8}<font color="white">NFCAPF STEERING COMMITTEE</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">KANG JI-HYE</font><font color="white"></font></font>

503
00:39:39,043 --> 00:39:40,795
{\an8}<font color="white">"Luca Domenico"?</font><font color="white"></font>

504
00:39:52,515 --> 00:39:53,474
{\an8}<font color="white">Deputy Director.</font><font color="white"></font>

505
00:39:54,683 --> 00:39:56,811
{\an8}<font color="white">What is this application</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for amendment approval?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

506
00:39:56,894 --> 00:39:58,270
{\an8}<font color="white">Oh, that.</font><font color="white"></font>

507
00:39:58,354 --> 00:40:01,273
{\an8}<font color="white">The Hankook Symphony wants to invite</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the Brno competition winner,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

508
00:40:01,357 --> 00:40:04,318
{\an8}<font color="white">Choi Jeong-yo, as a guest conductor.</font><font color="white"></font>

509
00:40:04,402 --> 00:40:05,319
{\an8}<font color="white">Wait a minute.</font><font color="white"></font>

510
00:40:05,820 --> 00:40:08,614
{\an8}<font color="white">This isn't what we agreed to</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when we approved the budget.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

511
00:40:08,697 --> 00:40:11,492
<font color="white">They can't suddenly submit</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">an amendment request like this.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

512
00:40:13,369 --> 00:40:14,537
<font color="white">The thing is,</font><font color="white"></font>

513
00:40:14,620 --> 00:40:17,623
<font color="white">it's pretty customary to do this</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for guest musicians.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

514
00:40:18,582 --> 00:40:21,252
<font color="white">And Maestro Kang Seung-woon</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">strongly recommended him.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

515
00:40:28,134 --> 00:40:29,051
<font color="white">Hello, ma'am.</font><font color="white"></font>

516
00:40:46,777 --> 00:40:47,611
<font color="white">Father.</font><font color="white"></font>

517
00:40:48,112 --> 00:40:49,155
<font color="white">Choi Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

518
00:40:49,947 --> 00:40:52,408
<font color="white">Did you suggest inviting him</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to join the Hankook Symphony?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

519
00:40:52,491 --> 00:40:53,826
<font color="white">Why do you ask?</font><font color="white"></font>

520
00:40:54,410 --> 00:40:55,786
<font color="white">You know why.</font><font color="white"></font>

521
00:40:55,870 --> 00:40:58,456
<font color="white">You never once gave Pi-o a second thought,</font><font color="white"></font>

522
00:40:58,539 --> 00:41:00,624
<font color="white">but the second that bastard shows up…</font><font color="white"></font>

523
00:41:01,375 --> 00:41:03,377
<font color="white">Do you realize</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">how much this will hurt Pi-o?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

524
00:41:03,961 --> 00:41:07,006
<font color="white">Why are you playing the victim again?</font><font color="white"></font>

525
00:41:07,590 --> 00:41:10,384
<font color="white">How can you still be so immature</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at your age?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

526
00:41:10,968 --> 00:41:13,721
<font color="white">Why does it have to be him of all people?</font><font color="white"></font>

527
00:41:13,804 --> 00:41:16,015
<font color="white">Pi-o suffered so much because of him!</font><font color="white"></font>

528
00:41:17,933 --> 00:41:20,478
<font color="white">You're missing the bigger picture,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as always.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

529
00:41:21,270 --> 00:41:24,398
<font color="white">Your son wasn't hurt back then.</font><font color="white"></font>

530
00:41:24,482 --> 00:41:27,485
<font color="white">He grew the most thanks to Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

531
00:41:28,110 --> 00:41:29,695
<font color="white">That's why he won the competition.</font><font color="white"></font>

532
00:41:30,821 --> 00:41:33,240
<font color="white">How can you work in cultural arts</font><font color="white"></font>

533
00:41:33,324 --> 00:41:35,284
<font color="white">and have zero insight like that?</font><font color="white"></font>

534
00:41:35,367 --> 00:41:38,287
<font color="white">Pi-o won the competition</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">on his own merits.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

535
00:41:38,370 --> 00:41:41,207
<font color="white">Jeong-yo was nothing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">but an obstacle in Pi-o's life.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

536
00:41:41,916 --> 00:41:44,543
<font color="white">I won't let Pi-o get hurt like that again.</font><font color="white"></font>

537
00:41:44,627 --> 00:41:45,544
<font color="white">Choi Jeong-yo?</font><font color="white"></font>

538
00:41:46,295 --> 00:41:47,713
<font color="white">Forget about asking him to join.</font><font color="white"></font>

539
00:41:48,339 --> 00:41:49,924
<font color="white">Stop throwing a tantrum and get out.</font><font color="white"></font>

540
00:41:50,007 --> 00:41:52,968
<font color="white">I don't have time to listen</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to your petty complaints.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

541
00:42:05,981 --> 00:42:09,026
<font color="white">Ma'am, Ms. Yoon</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of the Hankook Symphony is here.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

542
00:42:16,992 --> 00:42:19,203
<font color="white">Oh, you're here.</font><font color="white"></font>

543
00:42:20,037 --> 00:42:21,914
<font color="white">You asked for me, Ms. Kang?</font><font color="white"></font>

544
00:42:22,748 --> 00:42:24,959
<font color="white">I'm sorry for making you come</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when you're so busy.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

545
00:42:25,042 --> 00:42:28,045
<font color="white">You see, I have so much work to do</font><font color="white"></font>

546
00:42:28,128 --> 00:42:29,505
<font color="white">that I can't step away.</font><font color="white"></font>

547
00:42:29,588 --> 00:42:30,798
<font color="white">Please take a seat.</font><font color="white"></font>

548
00:42:42,351 --> 00:42:44,353
<font color="white">I asked you here because I received a form</font><font color="white"></font>

549
00:42:45,771 --> 00:42:48,566
<font color="white">saying you were appointing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">another principal guest conductor.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

550
00:42:49,275 --> 00:42:50,317
<font color="white">Would you mind…</font><font color="white"></font>

551
00:42:51,819 --> 00:42:53,529
<font color="white">explaining the reason to me?</font><font color="white"></font>

552
00:42:53,612 --> 00:42:56,407
<font color="white">Does that require an explanation?</font><font color="white"></font>

553
00:42:57,992 --> 00:43:01,161
<font color="white">You know the conductor</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">we're looking to appoint.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

554
00:43:01,245 --> 00:43:02,079
<font color="white">Right, Ms. Kang?</font><font color="white"></font>

555
00:43:02,663 --> 00:43:03,664
<font color="white">Of course.</font><font color="white"></font>

556
00:43:03,747 --> 00:43:05,124
<font color="white">How could I not know?</font><font color="white"></font>

557
00:43:06,417 --> 00:43:08,627
<font color="white">I was so happy and thankful to hear</font><font color="white"></font>

558
00:43:08,711 --> 00:43:11,380
<font color="white">that Jeong-yo came back alive.</font><font color="white"></font>

559
00:43:12,548 --> 00:43:16,969
<font color="white">Then I don't have to waste my time</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">telling you about his star quality.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

560
00:43:17,511 --> 00:43:20,848
<font color="white">His homecoming will be a much-needed boost</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for the Korean classical music scene.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

561
00:43:21,473 --> 00:43:23,684
<font color="white">Wouldn't you say</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">we deserve some praise for it?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

562
00:43:24,351 --> 00:43:27,104
<font color="white">And what about the cost</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of his star quality?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

563
00:43:28,063 --> 00:43:29,189
<font color="white">It'll cost more.</font><font color="white"></font>

564
00:43:30,274 --> 00:43:32,109
<font color="white">But if you insist on appointing him,</font><font color="white"></font>

565
00:43:32,985 --> 00:43:36,447
<font color="white">we'll need to rethink your subsidy grant.</font><font color="white"></font>

566
00:43:37,740 --> 00:43:38,991
<font color="white">Would you be okay with that?</font><font color="white"></font>

567
00:43:43,495 --> 00:43:44,496
<font color="white">What is it about Jeong-yo</font><font color="white"></font>

568
00:43:46,332 --> 00:43:47,708
<font color="white">that you dislike so much?</font><font color="white"></font>

569
00:43:50,628 --> 00:43:52,129
<font color="white">What are you talking about?</font><font color="white"></font>

570
00:43:52,630 --> 00:43:53,964
<font color="white">Who said I disliked him?</font><font color="white"></font>

571
00:43:54,048 --> 00:43:56,884
<font color="white">Jeong-yo isn't even</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Pi-o's competitor anymore.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

572
00:43:57,968 --> 00:44:01,013
<font color="white">Is there another reason why you--</font><font color="white"></font>

573
00:44:01,096 --> 00:44:02,556
<font color="white">Look here, Ms. Yoon.</font><font color="white"></font>

574
00:44:04,850 --> 00:44:08,354
<font color="white">Are you implying</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that I have no professional boundaries?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

575
00:44:08,437 --> 00:44:09,730
<font color="white">My point is,</font><font color="white"></font>

576
00:44:11,148 --> 00:44:13,609
<font color="white">chasing after stars like this</font><font color="white"></font>

577
00:44:13,692 --> 00:44:17,780
<font color="white">does nothing for the development</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of the classical music scene.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

578
00:44:20,032 --> 00:44:20,949
<font color="white">I see.</font><font color="white"></font>

579
00:44:22,576 --> 00:44:24,495
<font color="white">I understand now.</font><font color="white"></font>

580
00:44:26,664 --> 00:44:27,581
<font color="white">But what can I do?</font><font color="white"></font>

581
00:44:28,165 --> 00:44:30,793
<font color="white">I can't walk away</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from a good business opportunity.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

582
00:44:33,212 --> 00:44:34,254
<font color="white">It's disappointing…</font><font color="white"></font>

583
00:44:36,423 --> 00:44:39,176
<font color="white">but we'll pass on the grant.</font><font color="white"></font>

584
00:44:40,719 --> 00:44:43,972
<font color="white">I'm sure companies will line up</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to sponsor Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

585
00:44:44,973 --> 00:44:47,768
<font color="white">As a businesswoman,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I can't let such a big catch get away.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

586
00:44:49,269 --> 00:44:50,104
<font color="white">Please excuse me.</font><font color="white"></font>

587
00:45:16,171 --> 00:45:17,005
<font color="white">Try it.</font><font color="white"></font>

588
00:45:17,589 --> 00:45:20,884
<font color="white">I heard this place is super trendy,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so I stood in line to buy it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

589
00:45:27,599 --> 00:45:28,434
<font color="white">This is good.</font><font color="white"></font>

590
00:45:28,517 --> 00:45:30,269
<font color="white">Right? Isn't it good?</font><font color="white"></font>

591
00:45:35,065 --> 00:45:35,899
<font color="white">So good.</font><font color="white"></font>

592
00:45:40,112 --> 00:45:41,655
<font color="white">Here, try this too.</font><font color="white"></font>

593
00:45:45,784 --> 00:45:49,121
<font color="white">I got mad at how</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the concert manager handled things</font><font color="white"></font></font>

594
00:45:49,204 --> 00:45:50,247
<font color="white">and called them out.</font><font color="white"></font>

595
00:45:51,415 --> 00:45:52,499
<font color="white">Guess what they said?</font><font color="white"></font>

596
00:45:55,794 --> 00:45:57,379
<font color="white">Hey, Kang Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

597
00:45:59,131 --> 00:46:00,632
<font color="white">Are you listening to me?</font><font color="white"></font>

598
00:46:02,634 --> 00:46:04,636
<font color="white">Yeah, I am.</font><font color="white"></font>

599
00:46:04,720 --> 00:46:07,473
<font color="white">You weren't listening at all.</font><font color="white"></font>

600
00:46:09,558 --> 00:46:12,311
<font color="white">Sorry. I'm a little tired today.</font><font color="white"></font>

601
00:46:12,394 --> 00:46:13,312
<font color="white">It's okay.</font><font color="white"></font>

602
00:46:13,937 --> 00:46:15,939
<font color="white">It wasn't important anyway.</font><font color="white"></font>

603
00:46:17,483 --> 00:46:18,442
<font color="white">To be honest,</font><font color="white"></font>

604
00:46:18,942 --> 00:46:22,154
<font color="white">there's something else</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I really wanted to tell you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

605
00:46:23,947 --> 00:46:24,865
<font color="white">What is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

606
00:46:25,949 --> 00:46:27,075
<font color="white">Did you know</font><font color="white"></font>

607
00:46:27,784 --> 00:46:32,664
<font color="white">that Jeong-yo will be joining</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the Hankook Symphony Orchestra?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

608
00:46:33,832 --> 00:46:34,958
<font color="white">Oh, that.</font><font color="white"></font>

609
00:46:35,959 --> 00:46:37,044
<font color="white">Did he decide to do it?</font><font color="white"></font>

610
00:46:38,295 --> 00:46:39,338
<font color="white">You already knew?</font><font color="white"></font>

611
00:46:41,381 --> 00:46:42,799
<font color="white">It looks like</font><font color="white"></font>

612
00:46:42,883 --> 00:46:45,761
<font color="white">Mr. Kang specifically said</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to bring him in.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

613
00:46:46,512 --> 00:46:50,474
<font color="white">And Jeong-yo said he respected Mr. Kang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and wanted to collaborate with him.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

614
00:46:53,018 --> 00:46:55,521
<font color="white">That's great. Good for him.</font><font color="white"></font>

615
00:46:55,604 --> 00:46:57,064
<font color="white">Right?</font><font color="white"></font>

616
00:46:57,147 --> 00:46:58,440
<font color="white">It's great, right?</font><font color="white"></font>

617
00:46:59,274 --> 00:47:00,359
<font color="white">Yeah.</font><font color="white"></font>

618
00:47:00,442 --> 00:47:01,610
<font color="white">Then how would you feel…</font><font color="white"></font>

619
00:47:03,737 --> 00:47:05,197
<font color="white">about being the soloist</font><font color="white"></font>

620
00:47:06,323 --> 00:47:08,659
<font color="white">for Jeong-yo's debut performance?</font><font color="white"></font>

621
00:47:10,661 --> 00:47:11,703
<font color="white">What are you talking about?</font><font color="white"></font>

622
00:47:11,787 --> 00:47:12,746
<font color="white">I mean,</font><font color="white"></font>

623
00:47:13,747 --> 00:47:17,251
<font color="white">he's going to do a concerto anyway.</font><font color="white"></font>

624
00:47:17,334 --> 00:47:19,294
<font color="white">Since he'll need a soloist,</font><font color="white"></font>

625
00:47:19,962 --> 00:47:22,714
<font color="white">I thought it might be nice</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">if you gave it a try.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

626
00:47:23,632 --> 00:47:24,925
<font color="white">I don't want to.</font><font color="white"></font>

627
00:47:25,008 --> 00:47:26,343
<font color="white">-Why not?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-I just don't.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

628
00:47:27,719 --> 00:47:29,888
<font color="white">I don't want to</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">think about performing yet.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

629
00:47:34,476 --> 00:47:36,353
<font color="white">Don't be like that.</font><font color="white"></font>

630
00:47:37,229 --> 00:47:40,065
<font color="white">Just keep an open mind and think about it.</font><font color="white"></font>

631
00:47:40,148 --> 00:47:41,858
<font color="white">When you think about it,</font><font color="white"></font>

632
00:47:41,942 --> 00:47:45,487
<font color="white">you were the happiest</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when you played the piano with Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

633
00:47:46,071 --> 00:47:47,656
<font color="white">If you perform with Jeong-yo,</font><font color="white"></font>

634
00:47:47,739 --> 00:47:49,866
<font color="white">maybe you'll get out of your slump faster.</font><font color="white"></font>

635
00:47:49,950 --> 00:47:52,578
<font color="white">Why do I need Jeong-yo's help</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to get over that?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

636
00:47:53,579 --> 00:47:56,623
<font color="white">You think I'm too pathetic</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to get out of a slump on my own?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

637
00:47:57,541 --> 00:47:59,293
<font color="white">That's not what I meant.</font><font color="white"></font>

638
00:47:59,376 --> 00:48:03,005
<font color="white">I just need a little time.</font><font color="white"></font>

639
00:48:05,382 --> 00:48:07,384
<font color="white">Time to get back on track.</font><font color="white"></font>

640
00:48:16,018 --> 00:48:17,019
<font color="white">Mr. Kang.</font><font color="white"></font>

641
00:48:17,936 --> 00:48:19,187
<font color="white">Hi, Jae-in.</font><font color="white"></font>

642
00:48:19,980 --> 00:48:21,690
<font color="white">Are you just getting in?</font><font color="white"></font>

643
00:48:22,482 --> 00:48:25,944
<font color="white">I'm here to talk to Pi-o about something.</font><font color="white"></font>

644
00:48:26,612 --> 00:48:28,280
<font color="white">I see. That's good.</font><font color="white"></font>

645
00:48:29,823 --> 00:48:31,658
<font color="white">Come inside and have a cup of tea.</font><font color="white"></font>

646
00:48:31,742 --> 00:48:32,576
<font color="white">Pardon?</font><font color="white"></font>

647
00:48:37,039 --> 00:48:37,956
<font color="white">We meet again.</font><font color="white"></font>

648
00:48:39,499 --> 00:48:42,336
<font color="white">I had no idea you were his grandson.</font><font color="white"></font>

649
00:48:43,045 --> 00:48:44,504
<font color="white">I hear you're joining</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the Hankook Symphony.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

650
00:48:45,589 --> 00:48:46,506
<font color="white">That's good.</font><font color="white"></font>

651
00:48:47,716 --> 00:48:48,884
<font color="white">Let's talk inside.</font><font color="white"></font>

652
00:48:56,850 --> 00:48:59,311
<font color="white"><i>Jeong-yo isn't even</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Pi-o's competitor anymore.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

653
00:48:59,811 --> 00:49:03,273
<font color="white">Is there another reason why you…</font><font color="white"></font>

654
00:49:05,651 --> 00:49:07,235
<font color="white">I need to find a way.</font><font color="white"></font>

655
00:49:08,445 --> 00:49:09,446
<font color="white">There must be a way.</font><font color="white"></font>

656
00:49:39,768 --> 00:49:41,478
<font color="white">Times have changed, Mr. Kang.</font><font color="white"></font>

657
00:49:41,978 --> 00:49:43,855
<font color="white">There are more ways to market things now.</font><font color="white"></font>

658
00:49:44,356 --> 00:49:48,110
<font color="white">There are lots of young people</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who are wild about classical music.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

659
00:49:48,694 --> 00:49:50,612
<font color="white">If we just use social media effectively,</font><font color="white"></font>

660
00:49:51,446 --> 00:49:56,201
<font color="white">we won't have to rely solely on TV</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">or magazines to hype up the festival.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

661
00:50:04,292 --> 00:50:05,168
<font color="white">Hello, Ms. Kang.</font><font color="white"></font>

662
00:50:12,718 --> 00:50:14,511
<font color="white">I came to talk to Pi-o,</font><font color="white"></font>

663
00:50:14,594 --> 00:50:18,265
<font color="white">then Mr. Kang asked me to stay for tea.</font><font color="white"></font>

664
00:50:18,765 --> 00:50:19,808
<font color="white">Is that so?</font><font color="white"></font>

665
00:50:24,396 --> 00:50:25,397
<font color="white">Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

666
00:50:28,567 --> 00:50:29,568
<font color="white">Do you remember me?</font><font color="white"></font>

667
00:50:30,652 --> 00:50:31,820
<font color="white">I'm Pi-o's mom.</font><font color="white"></font>

668
00:50:35,615 --> 00:50:37,367
<font color="white">No, I'm sorry.</font><font color="white"></font>

669
00:50:38,118 --> 00:50:40,662
<font color="white">It's okay. I heard what happened.</font><font color="white"></font>

670
00:50:42,581 --> 00:50:44,249
<font color="white">I'm glad you look so well.</font><font color="white"></font>

671
00:50:45,167 --> 00:50:47,753
<font color="white">Don't just stand there.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Either go upstairs or sit down.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

672
00:50:48,211 --> 00:50:50,422
<font color="white">Don't make my guests uncomfortable.</font><font color="white"></font>

673
00:51:03,894 --> 00:51:07,439
<font color="white">I'm so grateful to see you again.</font><font color="white"></font>

674
00:51:10,484 --> 00:51:12,569
<font color="white">You must've gone through so much.</font><font color="white"></font>

675
00:51:13,403 --> 00:51:17,282
<font color="white">Do you mind if I ask</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">how you lost your memory?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

676
00:51:18,283 --> 00:51:19,951
<font color="white">Oh, I…</font><font color="white"></font>

677
00:51:21,286 --> 00:51:23,497
<font color="white">When I came to, I was at a monastery.</font><font color="white"></font>

678
00:51:24,539 --> 00:51:26,792
<font color="white">I refused to go to a hospital,</font><font color="white"></font>

679
00:51:26,875 --> 00:51:29,461
<font color="white">so I was treated by a monk</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who used to be a doctor.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

680
00:51:31,463 --> 00:51:32,339
<font color="white">When I woke up,</font><font color="white"></font>

681
00:51:33,507 --> 00:51:36,676
<font color="white">I had no memory of what happened,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">maybe due to the shock of surgery.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

682
00:51:37,636 --> 00:51:39,679
<font color="white">Oh dear. So that's what happened.</font><font color="white"></font>

683
00:51:41,598 --> 00:51:45,060
<font color="white">Yet you didn't give up</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and continued to study music.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

684
00:51:45,143 --> 00:51:46,061
<font color="white">I'm impressed.</font><font color="white"></font>

685
00:51:51,608 --> 00:51:54,319
<font color="white">Do you still find it difficult to play?</font><font color="white"></font>

686
00:51:59,282 --> 00:52:03,161
<font color="white">You still want to perform with him</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">despite his situation?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

687
00:52:09,376 --> 00:52:10,585
<font color="white">Mr. Kang.</font><font color="white"></font>

688
00:52:10,669 --> 00:52:14,172
<font color="white">Pi-o and Jeong-yo</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">haven't fully agreed to it yet,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

689
00:52:14,256 --> 00:52:15,423
<font color="white">so that's rather…</font><font color="white"></font>

690
00:52:15,507 --> 00:52:17,092
<font color="white">They can come to an agreement now.</font><font color="white"></font>

691
00:52:19,636 --> 00:52:20,554
<font color="white">Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

692
00:52:21,137 --> 00:52:24,599
<font color="white">Jeong-yo wants to do a concerto with you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for his debut performance.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

693
00:52:24,683 --> 00:52:26,017
<font color="white">What do you think?</font><font color="white"></font>

694
00:52:32,732 --> 00:52:34,526
<font color="white">I don't think this will work.</font><font color="white"></font>

695
00:52:34,609 --> 00:52:38,154
<font color="white">I'll recommend another soloist for you,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so give it another thought.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

696
00:52:39,406 --> 00:52:40,740
<font color="white">Well…</font><font color="white"></font>

697
00:52:40,824 --> 00:52:43,034
<font color="white">I want to perform with Kang Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

698
00:52:48,164 --> 00:52:51,126
<font color="white">He went out of his way</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">just to come see me.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

699
00:52:51,710 --> 00:52:55,338
<font color="white">I don't want to choose another soloist</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">just because of a little slump.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

700
00:52:56,131 --> 00:52:59,885
<font color="white">I want to follow Ms. Hong's suggestion</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and perform with him.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

701
00:53:02,470 --> 00:53:04,806
<font color="white">Pi-o, the truth is…</font><font color="white"></font>

702
00:53:06,182 --> 00:53:07,058
<font color="white">What do you think?</font><font color="white"></font>

703
00:53:08,351 --> 00:53:09,394
<font color="white">Are you against it?</font><font color="white"></font>

704
00:53:10,145 --> 00:53:11,730
<font color="white">I think it'll be quite fun.</font><font color="white"></font>

705
00:53:12,772 --> 00:53:14,107
<font color="white">Thanks for the offer,</font><font color="white"></font>

706
00:53:15,567 --> 00:53:16,818
<font color="white">but I'm not interested.</font><font color="white"></font>

707
00:53:22,324 --> 00:53:24,826
<font color="white">I'm sorry. Please excuse me.</font><font color="white"></font>

708
00:53:38,340 --> 00:53:39,174
<font color="white">Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

709
00:53:41,885 --> 00:53:42,761
<font color="white">Pi-o!</font><font color="white"></font>

710
00:53:43,845 --> 00:53:44,721
<font color="white">Wait a minute.</font><font color="white"></font>

711
00:53:45,221 --> 00:53:46,139
<font color="white">Hold on.</font><font color="white"></font>

712
00:53:47,474 --> 00:53:48,600
<font color="white">Hear me out before you go.</font><font color="white"></font>

713
00:53:49,184 --> 00:53:50,185
<font color="white">Look, I…</font><font color="white"></font>

714
00:53:52,062 --> 00:53:53,939
<font color="white">I'm really sorry for talking to Jeong-yo</font><font color="white"></font>

715
00:53:54,022 --> 00:53:55,941
<font color="white">without asking your permission first.</font><font color="white"></font>

716
00:53:56,024 --> 00:53:56,983
<font color="white">But the thing is,</font><font color="white"></font>

717
00:53:57,609 --> 00:54:00,987
<font color="white">I wanted to gauge Jeong-yo's interest</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">before trying to persuade you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

718
00:54:01,071 --> 00:54:02,906
<font color="white">Why would you ask him first?</font><font color="white"></font>

719
00:54:03,615 --> 00:54:05,200
<font color="white">You should've come to me first.</font><font color="white"></font>

720
00:54:05,784 --> 00:54:09,579
<font color="white">That's because I had to</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">clear some things with Jeong-yo first…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

721
00:54:11,873 --> 00:54:13,083
<font color="white">I'm sorry, Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

722
00:54:14,376 --> 00:54:16,419
<font color="white">I made a mistake. Just let it go and--</font><font color="white"></font>

723
00:54:16,503 --> 00:54:17,837
<font color="white">That's enough for today.</font><font color="white"></font>

724
00:54:18,755 --> 00:54:19,839
<font color="white">Let's talk later.</font><font color="white"></font>

725
00:54:20,924 --> 00:54:21,841
<font color="white">Okay?</font><font color="white"></font>

726
00:54:26,054 --> 00:54:27,097
<font color="white">Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font>

727
00:54:58,670 --> 00:55:01,339
<font color="white">I'm sorry for making a mess of things.</font><font color="white"></font>

728
00:55:03,299 --> 00:55:06,177
<font color="white">I should've known this would happen.</font><font color="white"></font>

729
00:55:07,262 --> 00:55:08,972
<font color="white">I didn't take it seriously enough.</font><font color="white"></font>

730
00:55:09,848 --> 00:55:10,849
<font color="white">It's okay.</font><font color="white"></font>

731
00:55:11,558 --> 00:55:13,184
<font color="white">I had a feeling he'd react that way.</font><font color="white"></font>

732
00:55:14,769 --> 00:55:15,937
<font color="white">So…</font><font color="white"></font>

733
00:55:16,021 --> 00:55:19,315
<font color="white">Does that mean</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you still want to perform with Pi-o?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

734
00:55:19,399 --> 00:55:20,692
<font color="white">Of course.</font><font color="white"></font>

735
00:55:20,775 --> 00:55:22,193
<font color="white">I wouldn't have it any other way.</font><font color="white"></font>

736
00:55:23,028 --> 00:55:25,155
<font color="white">Things just got a lot more interesting.</font><font color="white"></font>

737
00:55:46,176 --> 00:55:47,594
<font color="white">I'll be in touch.</font><font color="white"></font>

738
00:55:47,677 --> 00:55:48,845
<font color="white">Take care.</font><font color="white"></font>

739
00:55:48,928 --> 00:55:50,472
<font color="white">And thanks for today.</font><font color="white"></font>

740
00:55:51,222 --> 00:55:52,849
<font color="white">Okay. Drive home safely.</font><font color="white"></font>

741
00:55:52,932 --> 00:55:53,767
<font color="white">Okay.</font><font color="white"></font>

742
00:56:19,375 --> 00:56:20,335
<font color="white">Hey, bro.</font><font color="white"></font>

743
00:56:21,586 --> 00:56:22,629
<font color="white">I just got done.</font><font color="white"></font>

744
00:56:25,465 --> 00:56:26,299
<font color="white">Where?</font><font color="white"></font>

745
00:56:27,717 --> 00:56:28,843
<font color="white">Oh, there?</font><font color="white"></font>

746
00:56:29,385 --> 00:56:30,595
<font color="white">I remember.</font><font color="white"></font>

747
00:56:31,679 --> 00:56:32,680
<font color="white">I'll be right there.</font><font color="white"></font>

748
00:57:14,806 --> 00:57:16,224
<font color="white">CHOI JEONG-YO</font><font color="white"></font>

749
00:57:18,685 --> 00:57:20,019
<font color="white"><i>What was even more astonishing</i></font><font color="white"></font>

750
00:57:20,103 --> 00:57:23,148
<font color="white"><i>was your unique interpretation</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>of the set piece.</i></font><font color="white"></font></font>

751
00:57:23,231 --> 00:57:26,359
<font color="white"><i>How were you able to accomplish</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>such a difficult challenge?</i></font><font color="white"></font></font>

752
00:57:26,443 --> 00:57:27,902
<font color="white">I couldn't interpret it.</font><font color="white"></font>

753
00:57:27,986 --> 00:57:30,405
<font color="white"><i>Even if I compete,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>I'll just get eliminated.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

754
00:57:31,739 --> 00:57:34,159
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>I've memorized everything.</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>Take it if you need it.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

755
00:57:34,242 --> 00:57:38,121
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>I just focused on doing my best,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>and it led to a good result.</i></font><font color="white"></font></font>

756
00:57:38,705 --> 00:57:39,664
<font color="white"><i>Come to think of it,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

757
00:57:39,747 --> 00:57:42,125
<font color="white">you went to the same school</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as that competitor, right?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

758
00:57:42,208 --> 00:57:43,543
<font color="white">Were you close?</font><font color="white"></font>

759
00:57:43,626 --> 00:57:45,086
<font color="white">I have to enter</font><font color="white"></font>

760
00:57:45,170 --> 00:57:48,089
<font color="white">to help Pi-o get back on his feet.</font><font color="white"></font>

761
00:57:48,173 --> 00:57:50,633
<font color="white">If he needs me to light a fire under him,</font><font color="white"></font>

762
00:57:50,717 --> 00:57:52,677
<font color="white">I'll gladly do it.</font><font color="white"></font>

763
00:57:54,304 --> 00:57:56,890
<font color="white"><i>No. We weren't that close.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

764
00:58:12,363 --> 00:58:13,198
<font color="white">Yes?</font><font color="white"></font>

765
00:58:13,698 --> 00:58:15,325
<font color="white"><i>Hello, Mr. Domenico?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

766
00:58:15,408 --> 00:58:16,951
<font color="white"><i>I'm so sorry to bother you,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

767
00:58:17,035 --> 00:58:20,622
<font color="white"><i>but there's someone here</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>who says he's your friend</i></font><font color="white"></font></font>

768
00:58:20,705 --> 00:58:22,248
<font color="white"><i>and that he would like to see you.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

769
00:58:22,332 --> 00:58:23,208
<font color="white">A friend?</font><font color="white"></font>

770
00:58:23,833 --> 00:58:24,667
<font color="white">Who?</font><font color="white"></font>

771
00:58:25,293 --> 00:58:26,753
<font color="white"><i>It's Pi-o Kang.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

772
00:58:27,879 --> 00:58:29,047
<font color="white">Pi-o Kang?</font><font color="white"></font>

773
00:58:29,631 --> 00:58:30,882
<font color="white">I don't know who that is.</font><font color="white"></font>

774
00:58:38,306 --> 00:58:40,183
<font color="white"><i>I'm so thankful…</i></font><font color="white"></font>

775
00:58:40,767 --> 00:58:41,851
<font color="white">that you made it back alive.</font><font color="white"></font>

776
00:58:41,935 --> 00:58:43,603
<font color="white">Why are you thankful for that?</font><font color="white"></font>

777
00:58:43,686 --> 00:58:45,271
<font color="white">Because you were my friend</font><font color="white"></font>

778
00:58:45,855 --> 00:58:47,899
<font color="white">and I prayed for you to be alive.</font><font color="white"></font>

779
00:58:57,534 --> 00:59:00,411
{\an8}<font color="white">SPECIAL THANKS TO KO CHANG-SEOK</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">FOR HIS GUEST APPEARANCE</font><font color="white"></font></font>

780
00:59:20,807 --> 00:59:22,934
<font color="white">FOUR HANDS, TWO SONATAS</font><font color="white"></font>

781
00:59:23,017 --> 00:59:24,561
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Are you still afraid of going on stage,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

782
00:59:24,644 --> 00:59:26,896
{\an8}<font color="white">or are you uncomfortable</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">performing with me?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

783
00:59:26,980 --> 00:59:29,899
{\an8}<font color="white">By the way, what do you actually remember?</font><font color="white"></font>

784
00:59:30,483 --> 00:59:32,527
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Who was the man playing the piano?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

785
00:59:32,610 --> 00:59:33,528
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>He was quite good.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

786
00:59:33,611 --> 00:59:35,154
{\an8}<font color="white">How about we perform together?</font><font color="white"></font>

787
00:59:35,822 --> 00:59:38,199
{\an8}<font color="white">Why are you pretending</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to have amnesia anyway?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

788
00:59:38,283 --> 00:59:41,077
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Want me to break</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>a few of that bastard's fingers?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

789
00:59:41,160 --> 00:59:42,537
{\an8}<font color="white">What's the fun in that?</font><font color="white"></font>

790
00:59:42,620 --> 00:59:44,956
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>You're really considering</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>performing with him?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

791
00:59:45,540 --> 00:59:46,749
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>He's no good.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

792
00:59:47,500 --> 00:59:48,960
{\an8}<font color="white">Then do it with me.</font><font color="white"></font>

793
00:59:51,462 --> 00:59:56,467
{\an8}<font color="white">Subtitle translation by: Jenny Kim</font><font color="white"></font>
